# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# Sticky Notes: a separate application whose every note is a window of its
# own and a file of its own.  What was on disk comes back as windows, the
# first line is the title, a note that matters says so in its title, and
# what is typed reaches the file.
wait 20
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Documents
wait 4
menu-pick Sticky Notes
wait 100
note both notes came back; the one loaded last is in front, titled by
note its first line
expect-title Groceries
expect-windows 3
note the strip carries the note's own menu, from the description that
note came down the wire; marking a note important renames its tab and
note lands in its file
write /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings GlobalMenuBar on
wait 20
click-window Groceries
wait 4
click 60 8
wait 8
expect-menu Important
menu-pick Important
wait 10
expect-title ! Groceries
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/.local/share/notes/note-002.txt important=1
note two clicks on a word take the word, and typing replaces it
click 660 197
click 660 197
key L shift
key i
key s
key t
wait 6
expect-title ! List
note a new note starts empty, on the same paper, titled Note until typed
click-window List
wait 4
key n ctrl
wait 40
expect-title Note
key M shift
key i
key l
key k
wait 6
expect-title Milk
note undo and redo use the shared document history
wait 40
key X shift
key z ctrl
wait 4
expect-title Milk
key y ctrl
wait 4
expect-title MilkX
key z ctrl
wait 4
expect-title Milk
note the Edit menu and clipboard are available in the embedded plain view
key a ctrl
key c ctrl
key End ctrl
key v ctrl
wait 6
expect-title MilkMilk
shot /tmp/tiku-notes-rich-view.png
note the real window zoom control resizes and restores the embedded view
expect-window-at 750 156
click 848 166
wait 10
expect-window-at 0 21
expect-same-as-redraw
shot /tmp/tiku-notes-maximized.png
click 98 32
wait 10
expect-window-at 750 156
expect-title MilkMilk
note closing the window keeps the note: the file holds what was typed
key w ctrl
wait 60
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/.local/share/notes/note-003.txt Milk
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/.local/share/notes/note-003.txt MilkMilk
note Quit is the one row that ends the application: every note's window
note goes, and every note's file stays
click-window List
wait 4
click 60 8
wait 8
menu-pick Quit
wait 40
expect-no-title List
expect-no-title Buy milk
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/.local/share/notes/note-001.txt Buy milk
quit
